{"4025980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "APART", "steam_appid": 4025980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fueling the END of us.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >APART™ takes place after societies fall in the wake of a technological breakthrough that repurposed biological remains into an eco-centric fuel. The narrative balances horror with dark humor to tell a story of a fading parental presence and corporate malfeasance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as the DEAD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrect as a zombie child with a severed arm companion in a world long destroyed and filled with undead threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/bf7348a9727879636c5560437c71b82f.poster.avif?t=1787787616\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/bf7348a9727879636c5560437c71b82f.webm?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/bf7348a9727879636c5560437c71b82f.mp4?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fall APART, Work Together!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your way out of dangerous situations using two controllable characters who are equipped with unique abilities and characteristics that combine puzzles, action, and exploration for a wicked adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/bb9082bb38c55fbf4b562103c699fbe4.poster.avif?t=1787787616\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/bb9082bb38c55fbf4b562103c699fbe4.webm?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/bb9082bb38c55fbf4b562103c699fbe4.mp4?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Still here, somehow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The child is a shambling zombie. Limbs can be lost, replaced, and reassembled on the fly, turning character modularity into a core mechanic. When danger closes in, she can fall apart into pieces and reform where it’s safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4b678ca22b8c191229eb08a6b35eb540.poster.avif?t=1787787616\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4b678ca22b8c191229eb08a6b35eb540.webm?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4b678ca22b8c191229eb08a6b35eb540.mp4?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Need a hand?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The severed arm is agile. Able to explore hard-to-reach areas, slip past enemies, or puppeteer undead hosts, turning foes into tools for survival.   <br> <br>Players are encouraged to think creatively to navigate a world designed to pull them apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/140d37812e74885c68108571db9b2821.poster.avif?t=1787787616\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/140d37812e74885c68108571db9b2821.webm?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/140d37812e74885c68108571db9b2821.mp4?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted, lore-rich world oozing with narrative depth at every corner. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the infected, experience the zombie apocalypse from the perspective of a severed arm and an undead child.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, action, and exploration intertwined with deep lore about the fall of society due to corporate malfeasance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed by David Levy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming to Windows, MacOS, and handhelds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4cc8a33e0684f9bc23052c137273af44.avif?t=1787787616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras_big/4cc8a33e0684f9bc23052c137273af44.webp?t=1787787616 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fueling the END of us.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >APART™ takes place after societies fall in the wake of a technological breakthrough that repurposed biological remains into an eco-centric fuel. The narrative balances horror with dark humor to tell a story of a fading parental presence and corporate malfeasance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as the DEAD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrect as a zombie child with a severed arm companion in a world long destroyed and