b_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4b678ca22b8c191229eb08a6b35eb540.poster.avif?t=1787787616\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4b678ca22b8c191229eb08a6b35eb540.webm?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4b678ca22b8c191229eb08a6b35eb540.mp4?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Need a hand?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The severed arm is agile. Able to explore hard-to-reach areas, slip past enemies, or puppeteer undead hosts, turning foes into tools for survival.   <br> <br>Players are encouraged to think creatively to navigate a world designed to pull them apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/140d37812e74885c68108571db9b2821.poster.avif?t=1787787616\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/140d37812e74885c68108571db9b2821.webm?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/140d37812e74885c68108571db9b2821.mp4?t=1787787616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted, lore-rich world oozing with narrative depth at every corner. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the infected, experience the zombie apocalypse from the perspective of a severed arm and an undead child.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, action, and exploration intertwined with deep lore about the fall of society due to corporate malfeasance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed by David Levy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming to Windows, MacOS, and handhelds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras/4cc8a33e0684f9bc23052c137273af44.avif?t=1787787616\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/extras_big/4cc8a33e0684f9bc23052c137273af44.webp?t=1787787616 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p>", "short_description": "APART™ Is a third-person adventure game that follows an undead child with a severed arm companion whose bond seems to defy death. Survive and explore a world plunged into darkness after a tech breakthrough turns biological remains into humanity’s most valuable energy source.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/5ee158ef609e5a1916cac0127fa6099087e1819d/header.jpg?t=1787787616", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/86539f6c5abfeaa459f03b9d078863d9e47bc018/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787787616", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025980/86539f6c5abfeaa459f03b9d078863d9e47bc018/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787787616", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB